---
import { SITE, DISCLAIMER } from '../consts';
const jurisdiction = SITE.jurisdiction;
const officialSources = SITE.officialSources.fil;
const legal = {
	privacy: {
		path: '/privacy/',
		label: 'Patakaran sa Privacy',
	},
	terms: {
		path: '/terms/',
		label: 'Mga Tuntunin ng Serbisyo',
	},
	cookie: {
		path: '/cookie/',
		label: 'Mga Setting ng Cookie',
	},
};
---

<footer class="bg-pine-950 text-white/85">
	<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-14 sm:py-18 space-y-12 sm:space-y-14">

		<!-- 1. Sitemap / Quick links -->
		<div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-8 sm:gap-10">
			<div class="col-span-2 sm:col-span-1">
				<a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 font-bold text-lg text-white no-underline hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity duration-200 mb-3">
					<span aria-hidden="true">🏞️</span> Burnham Park
				</a>
				<p class="text-sm text-white/60 leading-relaxed max-w-xs">
					Isang independiyente at di-komersyal na gabay sa pinakamahalagang pampublikong parke ng Baguio.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div>
				<h4 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white/50 mb-3">Tungkol sa Parke</h4>
				<ul class="space-y-2.5">
					<li><a href="#tungkol" class="text-sm text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200 no-underline">Tungkol</a></li>
					<li><a href="#kasaysayan" class="text-sm text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200 no-underline">Kasaysayan</a></li>
					<li><a href="#alamat" class="text-sm text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200 no-underline">Pamana</a></li>
					<li><a href="#atraksyon" class="text-sm text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200 no-underline">12 Atraksyon</a></li>
					<li><a href="#gawain" class="text-sm text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200 no-underline">Mga Aktibidad</a></li>
				</ul>
			</div>

			<div>
				<h4 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white/50 mb-3">Plano</h4>
				<ul class="space-y-2.5">
					<li><a href="#praktikal" class="text-sm text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200 no-underline">Praktikal</a></li>
					<li><a href="#transportasyon" class="text-sm text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200 no-underline">Transportasyon</a></li>
					<li><a href="#pagkain" class="text-sm text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200 no-underline">Pagkain</a></li>
					<li><a href="#matutuluyan" class="text-sm text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200 no-underline">Matutuluyan</a></li>
				</ul>
			</div>

			<div>
				<h4 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white/50 mb-3">Higit Pa</h4>
				<ul class="space-y-2.5">
					<li><a href="#kalapit" class="text-sm text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200 no-underline">Kalapit</a></li>
					<li><a href="#galeriya" class="text-sm text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200 no-underline">Galeriya</a></li>
					<li><a href="#tip" class="text-sm text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200 no-underline">Mga Tip</a></li>
					<li><a href="#faq" class="text-sm text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200 no-underline">FAQ</a></li>
				</ul>
			</div>

			<div>
				<h4 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white/50 mb-3">Mapa</h4>
				<a
					href={SITE.mapsUrl}
					target="_blank"
					rel="noopener noreferrer"
					class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-white/10 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-white/20 transition-colors duration-200 no-underline"
				>
					🗺️ Buksan sa Google Maps
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>

		<!-- 2. Site-level neutrality & legal declarations (in TAGALOG for legal copy) -->
		<div class="pt-8 border-t border-white/10">
			<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5 sm:gap-6">
				<article class="rounded-2xl bg-white/[0.04] border border-white/10 p-5 sm:p-6 h-full">
					<p class="text-[0.7rem] sm:text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-white/50 mb-3">
						Katayuan ng Proyekto
					</p>
					<p class="text-sm text-white/75 leading-relaxed">
						Ang {SITE.projectName} ay isang independiyente at di-komersyal na proyektong gabay para sa mga bumibisita. Hindi ito kaakibat, sinang-ayunan, o itinataguyod ng anumang ahensya ng gobyerno, opisyal na tagapamahala ng atraksyon, o mga komersyal na tagapagpatakbo.
					</p>
				</article>

				<article class="rounded-2xl bg-white/[0.04] border border-white/10 p-5 sm:p-6 h-full">
					<p class="text-[0.7rem] sm:text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-white/50 mb-3">
						Mga Pinagmulan ng Impormasyon
					</p>
					<p class="text-sm text-white/75 leading-relaxed mb-3">
						Ang lahat ng impormasyon tungkol sa <strong class="text-white">{jurisdiction.attractionName}</strong> ay pinagbatay at sinuri mula sa mga pampublikong datos ng mga sumusunod na tanggapan sa antas ng lungsod at bansa:
					</p>
					<ul class="space-y-1.5 text-sm text-white/75">
						{officialSources.map((src) => (
							<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
								<span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1 text-pine-300">·</span>
								<span>{src}</span>
							</li>
						))}
					</ul>
					<p class="mt-3 text-xs text-white/60 leading-relaxed">
						Lahat ng nilalaman ay para lamang sa layuning magbigay ng impormasyon. Walang anumang komersyal na rekomendasyon, bayad na pagsasama, o pag-endorso.
					</p>
				</article>

				<article class="rounded-2xl bg-white/[0.04] border border-white/10 p-5 sm:p-6 h-full">
					<p class="text-[0.7rem] sm:text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-white/50 mb-3">
						Karapatan sa Larawan
					</p>
					<p class="text-sm text-white/75 leading-relaxed">
						Lahat ng larawang ipinapakita sa website na ito ay nananatiling pag-aari at may copyright ng kanilang orihinal na litratista o may-ari ng karapatan.
					</p>
					<p class="mt-3 text-xs text-white/60 leading-relaxed">
						Ang mga larawan ay ginagamit lamang para sa di-komersyal na pagpapaliwanag at konteksto ng pagbisita. Kung ang sinumang may-ari ng karapatan ay may pagtutol sa paraan ng paggamit, maaaring makipag-ugnayan sa amin sa pamamagitan ng nakasaad na paraan sa mga pahina.
					</p>
				</article>
			</div>
		</div>

		<!-- 3. Disclaimer / TAGALOG block -->
		<div class="max-w-4xl pt-8 border-t border-white/10">
			<p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white/50 mb-3">
				Patalastas
			</p>
			<p class="text-xs text-white/60 leading-relaxed">
				{DISCLAIMER.text}
			</p>
		</div>

		<!-- 4. Legal links -->
		<div class="pt-8 border-t border-white/10">
			<div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-4 sm:gap-6">
				<div class="col-span-2 sm:col-span-3 lg:col-span-2">
					<h4 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white/50 mb-3">Mga Patakaran</h4>
					<ul class="space-y-2.5">
						<li>
							<a
								href={legal.privacy.path}
								class="text-sm text-white/75 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200 no-underline"
							>
								{legal.privacy.label}
							</a>
						</li>
						<li>
							<a
								href={legal.terms.path}
								class="text-sm text-white/75 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200 no-underline"
							>
								{legal.terms.label}
							</a>
						</li>
						<li>
							<a
								href={legal.cookie.path}
								class="text-sm text-white/75 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200 no-underline"
							>
								{legal.cookie.label}
							</a>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>

		<!-- 5. Bottom bar -->
		<div class="pt-6 border-t border-white/10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-white/55">
			<span>
				© 2026 {SITE.projectName}. Lahat ng karapatan ay nakalaan.
				<span class="mx-2 text-white/20">·</span>
				{jurisdiction.attractionName} · {jurisdiction.region} · {jurisdiction.country}
			</span>
			<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-4 gap-y-2">
				<a href="/#patalastas" class="hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200 no-underline">Patalastas</a>
				<a href={legal.privacy.path} class="hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200 no-underline">{legal.privacy.label}</a>
				<a href={legal.terms.path} class="hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200 no-underline">{legal.terms.label}</a>
				<a href={legal.cookie.path} class="hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200 no-underline">{legal.cookie.label}</a>
			</div>
		</div>

	</div>
</footer>
